        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/8c91f0/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-09-19T04:36:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey all!</p>\n<p>Long time fan and lurker here! created an account finally just to ask about community content.</p>\n<p>So coming from DnD and Pathfinder, theres always a bit of a dirth of content (particulary for written adventures) at an edition launch. Has any one heard of plans to support community created contetn a la RPG Drivethu&nbsp;or DMsGuild?</p>\n<p>Also, has anyone started writing any adventures here? I've seen plenty of characters and homebrew rules but no oneshot or anything. I know its early and the Rulebook isn't out yet, but I'm just curious if anyone has run with the content we've got so far.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:53:06.731Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
