        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hey all!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Long time fan and lurker here! created an account finally just to ask about community content.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So coming from DnD and Pathfinder, theres always a bit of a dirth of content (particulary for written adventures) at an edition launch. Has any one heard of plans to support community created contetn a la RPG Drivethu&nbsp;or DMsGuild?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also, has anyone started writing any adventures here? I've seen plenty of characters and homebrew rules but no oneshot or anything. I know its early and the Rulebook isn't out yet, but I'm just curious if anyone has run with the content we've got so far.</p>",
