        "created_at": "2019-09-19T19:40:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As for publicly distributed content, I don't believe we've seen the license agreement for the system yet.&nbsp; It will probably be provided in the rulebook when it comes out.&nbsp; Then you'll know what you're allowed to publish in the way of third-party supplements.</p>",
